(0,6,'Prepare the mango and retrieve a peeler','Take the knife, attempt cuts through the unpeeled mango, put the knife down and pick at its sticker. Carry the mango to an utensil drawer, open it, retrieve a peeler and return to the cutting board.','Obtains a peeling tool after initial cutting attempts leave the whole mango intact.'),
