(59,65,'Add lemon juice and sugar','Pick up and uncap the green lemon juice bottle, pour liquid over the fruit, recap and set it down. Take the sugar shaker, pour white granules into the jug and fit the blender lid.','Combines the fruit with the visible added ingredients and covers the jug for blending.'),
(66,73,'Blend and scrape the mango mixture','Operate the blender while holding its lid. Lift the lid, take a spatula and scrape the jug walls, replace the lid and blend again. Remove the lid and central blade assembly and set the assembly on the board.','Breaks the mango into a coarse yellow mixture and removes the blade assembly for transfer.'),
