(79,86,'Cover and place the mixture in the freezer','Lift the container and green lid, carry them to the freezer and open its door while retaining the spatula. Set the box at the opening, smooth the mixture again, press on the lid, place the box on an upper shelf, rearrange a food package and close the door.','Covers the prepared mixture and briefly puts it inside the freezer; a frozen result is not established.'),
