procedure=[(0,33.9,'Hold the whole unpeeled mango and take a knife. Make repeated cutting attempts while rotating the fruit, but no cheek separates. Put down the knife, pick at the surface sticker, move to the utensil drawer and retrieve a black Y-shaped peeler before returning to the board.'),(33.9,79.9,'Peel successive sides of the mango with repeated downward strokes, turning it in the left hand between strokes. Skin strips accumulate on the cutting board. Put the peeler down when most of the yellow flesh is exposed.'),(79.9,128.02,'Take the knife and slice alongside the pit to separate broad cheeks and smaller side strips. Rotate and reposition the remaining fruit for further cuts. Set the exposed flattened pit to the left, then cut the flesh into chunks and lower the knife onto the board.'),(128.02,142.6,'Lift several handfuls of chopped mango into the open blender jug. Adjust the jug on its base, briefly turn the black central blade shaft, and continue picking up and dropping the remaining chunks.'),(142.6,153.5,'Take the green lemon juice bottle, unscrew its cap and pour liquid into the mango-filled jug. Replace the cap and set the bottle down. Take the clear sugar shaker, pour white granules into the jug, set the shaker down and fit the black lid.'),(153.5,203.4,'Hold the lid with the left hand and operate the blender buttons with the right. Stop and lift the lid, take the blue spatula and scrape mixture from the jug walls. Replace the lid and run the blender again. Remove the lid, pull out the central blade assembly and lay it on the cutting board.'),(203.4,218.1,'Lift the jug by its handle, tilt it over a clear rectangular storage box and scrape the coarse yellow mixture into the box using the spatula. Return the nearly empty jug to its base and spread the mixture inside the box.'),(218.1,235.23,'Pick up the green lid and lift the box. Carry it to the freezer and pull the door open while keeping the spatula. Set the box at the opening, smooth the mixture further, press the lid on and place the covered box on an upper shelf. Shift another food package to make room, withdraw and close the door.'),(235.23,274.734,'Carry the spatula to the dish rack and put it down. Open the utensil drawer and fetch a spoon. Return directly to the freezer, reopen it, bring the box to the opening and remove its green lid. Stir and scrape the mixture with the spoon while holding the lid in the other hand. Finish paused beside the uncovered box; no serving or visibly frozen result is shown.')]
